       reconsider Pf21 = Pg21 as PartFunc of [:RNS_Real,RNS_Real:],RNS_Real;
A132:  dom Pg21 = [:I,J:] by A131,A1,A3,MESFUN16:28; then
A133:  Pf21 is_continuous_on [:I,J:] by A1,A2,A3,Th20; then
